// Local build settings.
//
// Set DEVELOPMENT_TEAM to your Apple Developer team id — the 10-character
// string in the OU field of your signing certificate, or on the Membership page
// of developer.apple.com. Both targets need it: a File Provider extension talks
// to its host app through an App Group, App Groups are a provisioned
// capability, and ad-hoc signing cannot carry one.
//
// A free Apple ID is enough for local development.
//
// You can also override this without editing the file:
//
//   xcodebuild -scheme Plinth DEVELOPMENT_TEAM=ABCDE12345 build

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
